					<Button href="tel:702-222-1964" variant="primary">Call Dr. Jan: 702-222-1964</Button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Client Testimonials -->
		<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
				<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy-800 text-center mb-12">What Our Clients Say</h2>
				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
					<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
						<div class="text-gold-400 text-2xl mb-4">★★★★★</div>
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							"Kelly and Dr. Jan made the cross-state process seamless. I deferred $2.3M in taxes and my Las Vegas property has appreciated 45%. The coordination between California and Nevada was flawless."
						</p>
