					</div>
					<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
						<div class="text-gold-400 text-2xl mb-4">★★★★★</div>
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							"Eugene and Dr. Jan understood the entertainment industry's unique needs. The Henderson investment has been perfect for my portfolio, and the tax savings exceeded expectations."
